{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppeteer is a fast-paced combat game where you control a puppet battling iconic bosses from classic fairy tales. Set in a dramatic theatrical world, each fight is a test of skill and strategy. Face towering adversaries, master your puppet\u2019s abilities, and conquer the stage in a quest to break free from the strings of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/extras/02a38cd9858a4a5f6e21a67e2353330c.poster.avif?t=1770063418\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/extras/02a38cd9858a4a5f6e21a67e2353330c.webm?t=1770063418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/extras/02a38cd9858a4a5f6e21a67e2353330c.mp4?t=1770063418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Tales Fights in Theatrical World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a breathtaking theater-inspired world where every stage comes alive, reimagined villains from classic fairy tales, in epic battles that test your skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/extras/bbb0be2ac8e6c762fbac06a86038ab86.poster.avif?t=1770063418\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/extras/bbb0be2ac8e6c762fbac06a86038ab86.webm?t=1770063418\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537960/extras/bbb0be2ac8e6c762fbac06a86038ab86.mp4?t=1770063418\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=